Sound to me like it's a strategy to use in the middle game once
you can handle the risks in a game you're not avoiding XP levels.
Complete the mines and Sokoban.  Sometime between then and
battling Medusa go back and tap all of the fountains in the game.

Come to think about it, I've done that *because* of the risk in
games I've reached the Castle.  Get stats high enough that
foocubi encounters give good results, kick sinks until they give
a dish washer or convert to a fountain, tap the fountain for the
possibility of a wish now that my character can handle all of
the risks.  Since I'm already scanning levels for sinks, tap all
of the fountains as well.  In the past I've done it as an incidental
to foocubi dancing.  Now I'll ponder it as a risk/reward trade off
of its own rather than an incidental to sink strategy.


